BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sound & Soil: A Biodynamic Evening at Hamel
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T200000
UID:260429VNrxfAz50UWPOBSVZCvhKw
DESCRIPTION:Experience an evening of sound healing and estate wine tasting
  at Hamel\, rooted in our biodynamic farming philosophy. This immersive So
 noma wine country event begins with a one-hour sound bath led by The Celes
 tial Voice and Blue Muse Sound Healing\, designed to promote relaxation\, 
 balance\, and connection through vibration and deep listening.\n\nSet agai
 nst the peaceful backdrop of the Hamel estate\, guests will enjoy a medita
 tive sound journey using crystal singing bowls\, gongs\, chimes\, and ethe
 real vocals—no prior experience needed.\n\nFollowing the sound bath\, gu
 ests are invited to a seasonal light buffet and guided tasting of Hamel es
 tate wines. This intimate\, sensory-driven experience brings together soun
 d\, wine\, and nature\, highlighting the connection between land\, energy\
 , and biodynamic farming. Designed as an intimate evening\, limited to twe
 nty guests. **Reservations are required.**
LOCATION:Hamel Estate
URL:https://hamelfamilywines.com/events/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
