DESCRIPTION:Come join the fun at the Village with the Children’s Museum 
 of Sonoma County!\n\n**Lessons for Littles Series with Children’s Museum
  of Sonoma County – Saturday\, May 16th**\n\nCome join us for a fun and 
 educational event at **Montgomery Village in the Courtyard** hosted by 
 Children’s Museum of Sonoma County on Saturday\, May 16th. Enjoy a morn
 ing of hands-on\, engaging programming where kids will explore and learn t
 hrough play.\n\nThis event will take place at the Montgomery Village Court
 yard\, in the outdoor area in front of Cupcake Children’s Boutique and K
 aleidoscope Toys. Recommended for ages 4+. Space is limited\, please reser
 ve your spot today.\n\nPlease note\, you are still responsible for supervi
 sing your children throughout the entire event.\n\n*Please note that by ta
