DESCRIPTION:Join award-winning cartoonist **Brian Fies** to celebrate th
 e 20th anniversary of his groundbreaking graphic memoir\, *Mom’s Cancer
 *. Winner of the first-ever Eisner Award for Best Digital Comic\, *Mom’
