 ke place on Saturday\, May 16\, from 9:00 to 9:45 am at Lululemon at Montg
 omery Village. Mats will be provided\, and guests are encouraged to bring 
 water. Grip socks are optional.\n\nSpace is limited\, and advance registra
 tion is required.\n\nAdditional Information: By registering and attending 
 this class\, you acknowledge that you have read and understand this Releas
 e and Waiver and accept and agree to the terms and provisions contained in
