BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Art\, Sip & Stroll 2026 Tasting Package
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T170000
UID:260401i_onsfdYGEaShM7XPn-3JA
DESCRIPTION:Yountville Arts presents the 14th Annual Art\, Sip & Stroll\, 
 on \n\nSaturday\, May 16\, 2026\, from 11:00 AM to 5:00 PM. \n\nArt\, Sip 
 & Stroll\, the Napa Valley's largest visual arts event\, is an open-air ev
 ent offering visitors and valley residents the opportunity to enjoy fine a
 rt\, fine wine and great food in the heart of Napa Valley. There is no cha
 rge to enjoy the event\, which is situated throughout the center of town a
 nd ample parking is available. Once parked\, guests are encouraged to walk
  or use the free Yountville Bee Bus to travel throughout Town. \n\nStroll 
 downtown Yountville's Washington Street where over 70 juried artists\, win
 eries\, tasting rooms and live musical performances await attendees. For g
 uests who find that perfect painting\, sculpture\, ceramics\, photography\
 , jewelry or work of art in a variety of mediums\, concierge services are 
 available for shipping\, wrapping and will call to hold items until the en
 d of the event. Complete the day by purchasing lunch on site from local fo
 od vendors and relax in one of the town's park-like venues\, or make reser
 vations for lunch or dinner at one of Yountville's celebrated restaurants 
 at yountville.com/dining.\n\nGuests can enjoy the art at no charge\, or th
 ey can purchase an &ldquo\;Art\, Sip & Stroll&rdquo\; tasting package for 
 $50/pp which includes a tasting glass with 5 wine tasting tokens to be use
 d at over 20 unique wine tasting stops until 4 PM\, plus a signed Art\, Si
 p & Stroll 2026 poster. All proceeds from Art\, Sip & Stroll Tasting Packa
 ge sales support the Arts.
LOCATION:Yountville Community Center
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/art-sip-stroll-2026-tastin
 g-package?aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
