 e shared stages with Loggins and Messina\, The Eagles\, and Gregg Allman. 
 Together they mix original compositions with classic grooves that have kep
 t Sonoma County dance floors full for more than a decade. The show runs fr
 om 7:30 p.m. to 9:30 p.m. on Saturday\, May 16\, 2026. Advance tickets are
  $15 and tickets at the door are $22. Expect a night of live soul music in
  downtown Santa Rosa\, with horns\, rhythm\, and chemistry that sit somewh
 ere between a concert and a dance party.  Visit Website  Event Tickets
