DESCRIPTION:The Magic Banana Hour comes to Sebastiani Theatre for an unfor
 gettable evening of world-class comedy\, music\, magic\, and mayhem! This 
 turbo-charged variety show throws it back to the golden era of vaudeville 
 and classic TV specials\, featuring stars from Cirque du Soleil and Blue M
 an Group. Get ready for big laughs\, jaw-dropping circus acts\, banana jug
 gling\, magical puppets\, and even a surprise appearance by a California G
 rizzly Bear \\(yes\, really\\). Critics rave: "Inspired Comedy" - Variety 
 and "Eye-watering Vaudeville" - Time Out London. Perfect for a night out t
 hat's playful\, quirky\, and wildly entertaining!
