BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Judgment of Paris: The Grand Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T170000
UID:260324bm92Z2raSEGUi2CPV423zQ
DESCRIPTION:Taste Napa's Judgment of Paris victory! 50\\+ premier wines\, 
 gourmet stations\, French-American flea market\, live entertainment\, and
  much more!\n\nFifty years ago\, Napa Valley shocked the world. In 1976\,
  a blind tasting in Paris put American winemaking on the global map\, fore
 ver changing the course of wine history. Now\, half a century later\, we i
 nvite you to raise a glass to the legends\, the pioneers\, and the future 
 of wine.\n\nJoin us in the heart of Napa Valley for a spectacular\, immers
 ive four-hour Grand Tasting. Whether you are a devoted oenophile or simply
  looking for an unforgettable afternoon of world-class food\, culture\, an
 d entertainment\, this $250 all-access pass guarantees an experience of a 
 lifetime.\n\nThe Grand Tasting Wine Experience\n\nThe 1976 JOP Featured: 
 Step back in time and taste history. This exclusive honors the legendary w
 inning wineries of the original Judgment of Paris\, offering a rare opport
 unity to sip the legacy that started it all.\n\n50\\+ Premier Wineries: E
 mbark on a tasting journey through more than 50 of the finest estates\, sh
 owcasing the incredible diversity and world-class quality of modern winema
 king.\n\nCulinary Excellence\n\nGourmet Food Action Stations: Watch Culin
 ary Institute of America chefs in action as they prepare mouth-watering\, 
 freshly made bites designed to pair flawlessly with your wine selections.\
 n\nThe Grove Experience: Explore a vibrant\, bustling area perfect for gr
 abbing a gourmet bite\, relaxing in the shade\, and mingling with both tic
 keted and walk-in guests.\n\nCulinary Garden: Wander through our lush\, i
 nteractive garden space where the flavors of Napa come alive\, featuring f
 resh\, local ingredients and a lively\, open-air atmosphere.\n\nA Transatl
 antic Festival of Arts & Entertainment\n\nFrench/American Flea Market: St
 roll through a curated\, vintage-inspired market blending the rustic charm
  of a Parisian marché aux puces with classic Americana.\n\nLive Entertai
 nment Everywhere: Feel the energy of live musical performances by our DJ\
 , Bandjango\, who will be spinning the perfect soundtrack for a sunny Napa
  afternoon.\n\nStreet Performers: Experience the whimsy of a transatlanti
 c street fair with classic American street performers roaming the grounds.
 \n\nSecure your place in wine history. You aren't just buying a ticket to 
 a tasting\; you are stepping into a vibrant\, four-hour celebration of the
  exact moment Napa Valley became a global icon.
LOCATION:CIA at Copia (The Culinary Institute of America at Copia)
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/judgment-of-paris-the-g
 rand-tasting/18365024/2026-05-17T13
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
