 nd seasoned sewists alike\, this workshop shows you step-by-step how to co
 nstruct a durable pouch using minimal materials. Bring a pair of sturdy pa
 nts you’re ready to chop\, or use materials provided. \\(Sturdy fabric l
 ike denim or chinos work best.\\) Basic machine sewing experience suggeste
 d.
