  and material.\n\nParanormal Cirque is offering a special promotion: $5.00
  off any full priced ticket purchased in levels 1\, 2\, or 3. This offer c
 annot be combined with any other offers\, discounts or deals. Please call 
 941-704-8572 to get the promo code for your location.\n\nYou can purchase 
 tickets through our website \\(paranormalcirque.com/tickets\\) or by phone
 : \\(941\\) 704-8572. We also respond to text messages.\n\nWhen: May 22nd 
 – 25th\, 2026\n\nWhere: 1450 Bennett Valley Rd\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404\n
 \nAt: Sonoma County Event Center\n\n— Under the stunning White & Black 
 Big Top Tent\n\n·                     May 22 – Fri
 day: 7:30pm\n\n·                     May 23 – Sa
 turday: 6:30pm & 9:30pm\n\n·                     May
  24 – Sunday: 5:30pm & 8:30pm\n\n·                 
