DESCRIPTION:LaiddBackZach \\(LBZ\\) is a genre-blending recording and per
 forming artist known for fusing hip-hop\, funk\, soul\, and R&B\, into a
  sound that hits both the soul and the dance floor. LBZ brings a vibrant\,
  groove-heavy experience that keeps crowds moving and locked in. Coming fr
 om a background of poetry and a love for the stage\, LBZ has a presence th
 at makes the stage feel like home. Now\, to support a special cause they a
 re partnering with Audacity Rising Inc. to help raise funds to benefit 
 VIDAS who provides legal representation and family aid to our immigrant co
 mmunities in these challenging times.
LOCATION:Lost Church Santa Rosa
