DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the International Conference on Societal Transforma
 tion through Engineering\, Education\, Social Science\, and Humanities (IC
 STESH 2026)\, taking place on May 21 & 22\, 2026\, in the dynamic and rapi
 dly developing city of Astana\, Kazakhstan. Organized by IFERP Academy\, t
 his conference marks a transformative global platform where innovative min
 ds\, researchers\, educators\, policymakers\, and industry leaders converg
 e to inspire real-world impact.\n\nWith the theme “Bridging Innovation a
 nd Inclusion: Empowering Global Societal Transformation for a Sustainable 
 Future\,” ICSTESH 2026 aims to spark groundbreaking ideas\, foster cross
 -disciplinary collaboration\, and empower communities through knowledge-dr
 iven solutions. We warmly invite you to be part of this enriching experien
 ce as we collectively shape a future anchored in sustainability\, inclusiv
 ity\, and global progress.
LOCATION:Copperfield's Books- Petaluma
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/icstesh/18631089/2026-0
 5-22T09
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
