BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lucy Darling - Simply Darling
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260522T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260522T193000
UID:260419Db6AWdOBUUGooz7ArQ470g
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\nLucy Darling – Simply Darling\n\nFriday
 \, May 22\, 2026\n\n7:30 pm\n\nBUY TICKETS \n\nAward-winning performer Car
 isa Hendrix stars as the charming\, 1940s-style socialite and cocktail ent
 husiast Lucy Darling as she continues her vivacious vagabond voyages with 
 Simply Darling\, a touring variety show featuring her razor-sharp wit\, un
 questionable advice\, and skillful magic. Now that Lucy is bringing her si
 gnature charm and mischief from screen to stage with Simply Darling\, it
 ’s the perfect chance to take a break from reality and indulge in the mi
 schief\, sarcasm\, and wonder that we all deserve. \n\nPre-Show Talkback \
 n\nEnjoy a candid conversation with Carisa Hendrix \\(the performer behind
  Lucy Darling\\) two hours before showtime. Hear never-before-told stories
 \, ask your own questions\, and get a behind-the-scenes look at the artist
 ry behind the performance. Limited spots available. \n\nPost-Show Meet & G
 reet \\(limited availability\\) \n\nPost-Show Meet & Greet includes meeti
 ng Lucy Darling after the show and taking a professional photograph with t
 he icon herself. Guests will also receive a limited-edition lanyard and an
  exclusive merchandise gift to remember the night. The perfect cherry on t
 op of an unforgettable evening. \n\nAge restriction for 13 years\\+ \n\n \
 n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\n\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online reseller
 s who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe
  way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest c
 ost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at ou
 r box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team mem
 bers are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide custom
 er support.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/703605139440662/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BFA Exhibition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260522T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260522T160000
UID:260417BcHk_-oqRUGTVhPkFOyD4A
DESCRIPTION:Each spring\, the University Art Gallery proudly presents the 
 Bachelor of Fine Arts \\(BFA\\) Exhibition\, showcasing the work of Sonoma
  State University's graduating BFA class. The 2026 BFA Exhibition will be 
 on view April 23-May 23\, 2026. Offered by SSU's Art Department\, the BFA 
 degree is distinguished from the BA by its rigorous\, studio-intensive cur
 riculum. The program requires an additional year of focused study\, includ
 ing advanced coursework in studio art\, art history\, and art theory. Ofte
 n regarded as the degree of choice for students pursuing graduate or profe
 ssional studies\, the BFA fosters significant artistic development within 
 a concentrated creative environment. For both students and faculty\, this 
 exhibition represents a culminating achievement-an opportunity to present 
 a carefully curated selection of each artist's strongest work in a profess
 ional gallery setting\, exhibited alongside their peers. Opening Reception
 : Thursday\, April 23\, 2026 4:00-6:00 pm
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/bfa-exhibition/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
