BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Line Dancing Workshop for Beginners
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T190000
UID:260511t54_WnGENkKsDUZEjTvoaw
DESCRIPTION:This Session\n\nEvent Series \\(See All\\)\n\nSaturday\, May 2
 3\, 2026 from 4:00 pm to 7:00 pm\n\nWorkshop from 4:00 PM – 5:00 PM Soci
 al from 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 110\n\nExperience Level\n\
 nBeginning\n\nEvent Category: Dance\n\nAge\\(s\\)\n\n18 and older\n\nRegis
 tration\n\nSocial Only:\n\n$15\n\nWorkshop & Social:\n\n$40\n\nReady to tr
 y line dancing—or get more confident on the floor? Join us for a fun\, w
 elcoming Beginner Line Dancing Workshop and Social\, designed especially f
 or absolute beginners and those who have never line danced before.\n\nAbou
 t the Class\n\nReady to try line dancing-or get more confident on the floo
 r? Join us for a fun\, welcoming Beginner Line Dancing Workshop and Social
 \, designed especially for absolute beginners and those who have never lin
 e danced before. The event includes three hours of structured Beginner–I
 mprover instruction\, where you’ll learn foundational steps\, easy-to-fo
 llow dances\, and build confidence at a comfortable pace. No experience re
 quired-just show up ready to move and have fun. Our instructors break ever
 ything down clearly\, making it approachable\, supportive\, and stress-fre
 e. After the workshop\, enjoy three hours of an open social dance\, where 
 you can practice what you’ve learned\, dance at your own pace\, and enjo
 y a relaxed\, friendly atmosphere. Dances will be beginner-friendly\, with
  plenty of opportunities to jump in or take a break as needed. Come solo o
 r bring friends-no partner needed. Whether you’re brand new\, curious ab
 out line dancing\, or looking for a fun night of movement and music\, this
