 ems. Pop hits you still know every word to.\n\n• The Theme: “Millenni
 um Fever” \\(Think baggy jeans\, butterfly clips\, windbreakers\, and p
 latform sneakers!\\)\n\n• Special Guest: An exclusive 90s-inspired perf
 ormance by the incredible James Darling.\n\n• Fuel: Complimentary wine
