BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The California Honeydrops | Cookout Concert Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260525T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260525T180000
UID:260325hh7SWB8btkmsDMHn6AqBYw
DESCRIPTION:KC TURNER PRESENTS  THE CALIFORNIA HONEYDROPS BottleRock After
 Dark 13th Annual COOKOUT CONCERT SERIES HOPMONK NOVATO OUTDOOR VENUE Spons
 ored by JAMBAR MOSTLY STANDING ON GROUND LEVEL LIMITED SEATING ON LAWN & T
 OP OF HILL ALL AGES ABOUT: “The California Honeydrops...evoke the greasy
  rumble of Booker T and channel the spiritual ecstasy of Sly and the Famil
 y Stone.” -Rolling Stone Formed in the subway systems of Oakland\, retro
 -soul outfit The California Honeydrops are an electrifying group that defy
  convention at every turn. They’ve become a mainstay at festivals includ
 ing Byron Bay Bluesfest \\(Australia\\)\, Outside Lands\, Monterey Jazz\, 
 Lightning In A Bottle\, and touring with B.B. King\, Dr. John\, Bonnie Rai
 tt\, Buddy Guy\, and Allen Toussaint. Led by the enigmatic and energetic f
 rontman\, Lech Wierzynski\, and percussionist Benjamin Malament\, each mem
 ber of the band is a virtuoso in their own rite — Yanos “Johnny Bones
 ” Lustig on saxophone\, Lorenzo Loera on keyboards/guitar\, Beaumont Bea
 ullieu on drums\, Miles Blackwell on bass\, and regularly accompanied by O
 liver Tuttle on trombone\, Leon Cotter on saxophone/clarinet\, and Miles L
 yons on trombone/sousaphone — navigating through a vast repertoire of or
 iginal songs and timeless classics every night. But what truly sets them a
 part is their unwavering commitment to the art of improvisation - a skill 
 so finely honed that they have completely abandoned the use of set lists a
 nd no two shows are ever the same. Off stage\, their music has been stream
 ed more than 200 million times\, and placed in a variety of TV and films\,
  including “Dead To Me\,” “Alaska Daily\,” “Black-ish” and mor
 e. Their new album “Redwood Highway” was released August 8\, 2025. ---
 -------------------------------- EVENT INFO: Q: Is this show outdoors? A: 
 Yes. This event is held in HopMonk Novato's outdoor concert venue. Q: Are 
 kids allowed? A: The shows are all ages. Kids need a ticket to attend. No 
 babies in arms. Q: Is there seating? A: Seating is limited and is first co
 me. You're allowed a LOW-BACK chair in the lawn section. At the top of the
  hillside section there is table seating that is first come. We recommend 
 arriving at the time doors open. Some shows are open dance floor/standing 
 room only while others are mostly seated. Varies from show to show. Q: Is 
 there parking? A: Parking is free and there is plenty of it. NO PETS NO CO
 OLERS NO BACKPACKS NO OUTSIDE FOOD NO UMBRELLAS NO REFUNDS | ALL SALES FIN
 AL Tickets: After completing your purchase on See Tickets\, you will recei
 ve an email confirmation with your attached PDF ticket\\(s\\). You MUST pr
 int and bring your PDF tickets AND VALID PHOTO IDENTIFICATION to be admitt
 ed for the event. You may download the See Tickets app and show your ticke
 t on your mobile device for entry in lieu of printing.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern Novato
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1724454618531426/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Paranormal Cirque Voodoo Santa Rosa\, CA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260525T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260526T000000
UID:260511nNhfXl_XPkqg4vmu7UyQeg
DESCRIPTION:For Additional Information: \n\n Leah Hryniewicki\, Public Re
 lations\, and Media Manager\n\n             \\(t\\) 941.704.85
 72 Ext 216           leahhryniewicki@cirqueitalia.com\n\n2026 Pr
 ess Release – Paranormal I - VOODOO \\(BLACK UNIT\\)\n\nCirque Italia is
  now presenting:\n\n“PARANORMAL CIRQUE!”\n\nONE OF THE BEST THRILLING 
 EXPERIENCES!!!\n\nComing to Santa Rosa\, CA from May 22nd – 25th!\n\nAre
  you ready Santa Rosa? Do you love thrilling\, wicked\, sexy\, or even dan
 gerous things? Paranormal Cirque will expose you to a unique creation of c
 ombined theatre\, circus\, and cabaret with a new European style flare. Ci
 rque Italia is now presenting a brand-new show for a MATURE audience! \n\
 nThis innovative horror story features different shades of sexy and an inc
 omparable storyline - the only thing you can be sure of during this unique
  experience is that you will not know what to expect!  It might be hard t
 o divide reality and illusion!\n\n Are you intrigued yet? Dare to let you
 rself get wicked for one night under our Big TOP and live on the edge with
  Paranormal Cirque show! You will fall into a parallel world and end up su
 rrounded by monstrous creatures with hidden talents that will amaze you wi
 th the circus arts. This show is NOT for the faint of heart. You may have 
 to catch your breath or try to stop your heart from racing during this adr
 enaline filled performance. \n\nA careful casting selection has united th
 e best artists from all over the world. A few of the circus arts you can e
 xpect to see in this new production include the jaw-dropping Wheel of Deat
 h\, mystifying MAGIC\, and more. Our Black unit also follows our strict an
 imal-free policy.\n\nFor more information visit www.paranormalcirque.com a
 nd make sure to check all our social media accounts. Tickets can be purcha
 sed now starting at $10.00 depending on availability. Restricted – under
  18 REQUIRES accompanying parent or guardian. This show has adult language
  and material.\n\nParanormal Cirque is offering a special promotion: $5.00
  off any full priced ticket purchased in levels 1\, 2\, or 3. This offer c
 annot be combined with any other offers\, discounts or deals. Please call 
 941-704-8572 to get the promo code for your location.\n\nYou can purchase 
 tickets through our website \\(paranormalcirque.com/tickets\\) or by phone
 : \\(941\\) 704-8572. We also respond to text messages.\n\nWhen: May 22nd 
 – 25th\, 2026\n\nWhere: 1450 Bennett Valley Rd\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404\n
 \nAt: Sonoma County Event Center\n\n— Under the stunning White & Black 
 Big Top Tent\n\n·                     May 22 – Fri
 day: 7:30pm\n\n·                     May 23 – Sa
 turday: 6:30pm & 9:30pm\n\n·                     May
  24 – Sunday: 5:30pm & 8:30pm\n\n·                 
     May 25 – Monday: 7:30pm\n\nBox office hours:\n\nThe box office 
 opens on-site on Tuesday\, the week of the show.\n\nNon-show days: 10am 
 – 6pm\n\nOn show days: 10am – 10pm
LOCATION:Sonoma County Event Center
URL:https://www.paranormalcirque.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
