DESCRIPTION:Step into a higher class of cannabis. **Elevated Sessions** is
  an intimate\, sommelier-led tasting experience featuring award winning **
 Fig Farms** premium indoor flower and curated for the true cannabis connoi
 sseur.\n\nJoin us for a refined **60 minute** session designed to awaken t
 he senses. Your cannabis sommelier will guide you through **4 exceptional 
 cultivars** — exploring their terpene profiles\, aromas\, flavors\, and 
 effects — while you savor a drink from the natural soda bar\, curated sn
 acks\, and palate cleansers.\n\nThis is more than a tasting — it’s an 
 immersive journey through craft cannabis\, where every detail is designed 
 to elevate your evening\, from the intimate atmosphere to the exclusive pe
 rks awaiting guests.\n\n**Date & Sessions**\n\n**Date:** Friday\, May 29\,
  2026\n\n**Two Sessions:** 6:00 PM & 8:00 PM\n\n**Capacity:** 16 guests pe
 r session (32 tickets total)\n\n**What’s Included**\n\n**Enjoy a refresh
 ing Natural Soda** – A cannabis-infused palate opener\n\n**Guided Tastin
 g of 4 Curated Strains** –Guests enjoy exclusive cultivar drop\n\n**Tast
 ing Passport** – Track aromas\, effects\, and personal favorites\n\n**Ch
 arcuterie & Palate Cleansers** – Light bites designed for the session\n\
 n**Meet The Grower** – Learn how this award-winning flower was grown\n\n
 **Exclusive Perks** – Discounts + access to limited drops\n\n**Ticket Ti
 ers (Limited to 16 Guests per Session)**\n\n**6:00 PM Tasting - $75:** Inc
 ludes 🌱 $50 Goodie Bag\, 4 Curated Tastings\, Tasting Passport\, Natura
 l Soda Bar\, Snacks & Exclusive Deals\n\n**8:00 PM Tasting - $75:** Includ
 es 🌱 $50 Goodie Bag\, 4 Curated Tastings\, Tasting Passport\, Natural S
 oda Bar\, Snacks & Exclusive Deals\n\n21+ Only | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC
