DESCRIPTION:Madison Valley Ranch Wine Dinners  Ennis\, MT Escape to Montan
 a for a truly memorable getaway! Second-Generation Winery Owners Kim and D
 on Wallace\, along with their son\, Spencer\, invite you to join them for 
 an unforgettable evening of wine\, food and hospitality at the Madison Val
 ley Ranch\, an Orvis-endorsed fly-fishing lodge in Ennis\, Montana. Now a 
 cherished annual tradition\, these intimate dinners bring Dry Creek Vineya
 rd to "Big Sky Country" for a one-of-a-kind experience. Each night will fe
 ature a unique multi-course menu perfectly paired with a special selection
  of our wines. Limited seats remain for the May 30\, 2026\, dinner. The wi
 ne dinner on May 29\, 2026\, is sold out.    LEARN MORE
LOCATION:Dry Creek Vineyard
URL:https://www.drycreekvineyard.com/events/page/2/
