BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petaluma River Full Moon Paddle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T213000
UID:260306Jd2-eluKiU-4e_0iO20Kxg
DESCRIPTION:Come play on the river at night.\n\nJoin The Floathouse for a 
 magical evening paddle on the Petaluma River—Petaluma’s Longest Park
 —timed to catch the full moon rising over the wetlands just south of dow
 ntown. As twilight fades\, we’ll head out together in Hobie pedal kayaks
  for a relaxed\, guided glide that turns nighttime into playtime.\n\nThese
  pedal-powered kayaks make the journey smooth and easy\, even if there’s
  a breeze or moving tide. We’ll cruise about a mile and a half downriver
  to the perfect moonrise vantage point\, where calm water\, wide skies\, a
 nd glowing reflections set the scene.\n\nThis is a social\, feel-good outd
 oor experience designed for anyone looking for something a little differen
 t to do after dark—part nature\, part adventure\, part pure vibe.\n\n$60
  per person includes everything: • Hobie pedal kayak • PFD and safety 
 lights • Experienced local guide • A memorable\, moonlit river experie
 nce\n\n✨ Easy. Playful. Peaceful. Spend your evening under the full moon
 —on the water.
LOCATION:The Floathouse Petaluma
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/petaluma-river-full-moo
 n-paddle/17974383/2026-05-30T19
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kombucha & Jun Fundamentals
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T180000
UID:260513dEpgGrngjE6KhirsdK-1Kg
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to brew and flavor kombucha and jun in this hands-on
  fermentation workshop. You’ll explore the full process—from brewing t
 ea to bottling—while working with these traditional fermented beverages.
 \n\n**In this workshop you’ll:**\n\n• Learn how to brew kombucha and j
 un at home\n\n• Understand the role of the SCOBY and fermentation proces
 s\n\n• Taste finished ferments and learn how to gauge readiness\n\n• E
 xplore flavoring methods using fruit\, herbs\, and botanicals\n\n• Bottl
 e your own flavored kombucha or jun\n\nYou’ll leave with a **SCOBY\, st
 arter liquid\, and your own bottled ferment** to continue brewing at home
 . No experience required.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/kombucha-jun-fermented-beverages
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bricoleur Vineyards Essentials Picnic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T153000
UID:260508v_1Xr394TUS6tMndP6402g
DESCRIPTION:Bricoleur Vineyards’ beloved Essentials Picnic pairs a b
 ottle of wine with charcuterie\, presented in a quintessential wicker bask
 et and a chic red wagon\, offering a relaxed and beautifully curated alfre
 sco wine country experience. Guests can enjoy their picnic in picturesque\
 , family- and dog-friendly settings across the estate—whether on the Pav
 ilion lawn\, beneath the trellis by the pond\, or at the picnic tables nes
 tled within the culinary and rose gardens. With exceptional wines\, thou
 ghtfully crafted foods\, and sweeping vistas\, a visit to Bricoleur Vin
 eyards offers a laid-back\, family-friendly atmosphere featuring lawn ga
 mes\, board games\, scavenger hunts\, and catch-and-release fishing.
LOCATION:Bricoleur Vineyard
URL:https://bricoleurvineyards.com/pages/visit?srsltid=AfmBOoq4MRc2MHal1tH
 0HwUmLbCHlVrPlsnizqNwrRFitw3UKui4rRJV
