DESCRIPTION:with Land + Local\n\nExplore the art of crafting botanical syr
 ups and shrubs in this hands-on workshop with Land + Local. Using seasonal
  fruits\, herbs\, and medicinal plants\, you’ll create flavorful mixers 
 for your home bar.\n\n**In this workshop you’ll:**\n\n• Learn the basi
 cs of shrubs and botanical syrups\n\n• Explore herbs\, fruits\, and plan
 ts for flavor and function\n\n• Taste and experiment with seasonal ingre
 dients\n\n• Create one custom shrub and one botanical mixer\n\nYou’ll
  leave with **two non-alcoholic mixers** and recipes to continue at home
 . Light snacks provided. No experience required.
