DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T123000
UID:260508tMkb11aX20adO8NHcXx5rQ
DESCRIPTION:Step into a thoughtfully curated morning of creativity and sel
 f-care at Montgomery Village. Hosted by Anna Weaver\, Botanical Alchemy in
 vites guests to explore the art of blending essential oils into personaliz
 ed\, plant-powered creations designed to enhance mood\, elevate your space
 \, and support everyday rituals.\n\nGuided by a spirit of intention and di
 scovery\, this hands-on workshop offers a relaxed and welcoming environmen
 t for both beginners and experienced makers alike. During the workshop\, g
 uests will create:\n\n\\- A custom room or body spray\n\n\\- A personalize
 d roller oil blend\n\n\\- Bath salts or an incense bundle\n\nThe workshop 
 fee includes your choice of three handcrafted creations\, with the option 
 to make additional pieces.\n\nDetails:\n\n\\- 90-minute session\n\n\\- Hel
 d outdoors (undercover) at Made Local Marketplace\n\n\\- Advance registrat
 ion required. Space is limited\, and a minimum of four participants is req
 uired. A minimum of 72 hours’ notice is needed for partial refunds.
LOCATION:Made Local Marketplace at Montgomery Village
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/botanical-alchemy-a-spirit-body-
 workshop-at-made-local-marketplace/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
