SUMMARY:The Ramble at Abel de la Luna Community Center Fields
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T120000
UID:260419td0r6rGsGk-x_l_W-pyKFw
DESCRIPTION:The Ramble is an intimate music\, food\, and wine festival in 
 Sonoma County\, thoughtfully designed for connection\, discovery\, and imp
 act. This boutique event brings together acclaimed artists\, local cuisine
 \, and exceptional wines in a setting that feels personal and intentional.
  The Ramble offers a rare experience that celebrates the wine country life
 style while fostering a deeply engaged community. Driven by purpose\, with
  100% of proceeds donated to support efforts to end gun violence through i
 ts partnership with GIFFORDS\, honoring lives lost and working toward a sa
 fer future.
