BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Sidemen Live at Buena Vista Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T210000
UID:2604126-1OqBN5AkWmXfDD2S0nwQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable evening of world‑class jazz as 
 The Sidemen bring their powerhouse sound to the historic Buena Vista Winer
 y. Surrounded by Sonoma’s oldest vines and timeless charm\, this concert
  pairs the region’s finest wines with the deep swing and soulful energy 
 of a seven‑piece jazz ensemble at the top of their game.\n\nWith three h
 orns out front and a rhythm section built for lift‑off\, The Sidemen del
 iver a sound that’s tight\, expressive\, and steeped in the jazz traditi
 on.\n\nThe Music\n\nExpect a night of straight‑ahead jazz\, featuring or
 iginal three‑horn arrangements crafted by the band. Their set draws from
  the iconic works of: Charles Mingus\, John Coltrane\, Wayne Shorter\, Can
 nonball Adderley …and other masters who shaped the language of modern ja
 zz.\n\nThese arrangements honor the spirit of the originals while giving e
 ach musician room to stretch\, converse\, and ignite the stage.\n\nWhy Thi
 s Night Will Stand Out\n\nA rare chance to hear three‑horn arrangements 
 performed by some of the region’s most respected improvisers\n\nA settin
 g that blends historic Sonoma elegance with the spontaneity of live jazz\n
 \nA perfect pairing of wine\, atmosphere\, and musicianship\n\nEnjoy Dinne
 r With TriTip Trolley!\n\nSettle in with a glass of Buena Vista’s finest
  and let The Sidemen take you on a journey through the heart of the jazz t
 radition. June 6 is going to swing.
LOCATION:Buena Vista Historical Winery
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/the-sidemen-live-at-bue
 na-vista-winery/18544100/2026-06-06T18
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
