BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. Open Hearts Band
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T180000
UID:260206yEbJzZ5GbUy08i7xtuv4pg
DESCRIPTION:*Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come 
 together.*\n\nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a ta
 sting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acr
 oss the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll 
 and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new so
 unds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**Open Hearts Band** Open Hear
 ts Band delivers home-grown folk rock with heartfelt lyrics\, rich harmoni
 es\, and a soulful groove that sticks with you. Blending original songwrit
 ing with raw acoustic energy\, their sound is equal parts nostalgic and re
